# --- Asset generation tooling -------------------------------------------------
# Tripo CLI. The API key lives in ~/.tripo (outside the repo) and must stay there;
# `.tripo/context.json` is written into whatever directory the CLI runs from and
# carries task history, so it is ignored rather than trusted to be harmless.
.tripo/
tripo-out/

# Raw generation and download sources: ~50 MB per Tripo mesh, and Mixamo FBX files.
# These are inputs to the asset pipeline, not deliverables, and the repository has
# never held binaries.
#
# Written to ignore the *contents* rather than the directories, so a fresh clone still
# gets the folders the pipeline expects to find. `assets/source/` alone would exclude
# the directory itself, and git does not descend into an excluded directory — the
# .gitkeep negation below would never be reached.
assets/source/*
!assets/source/mixamo/
!assets/source/tripo/
assets/source/mixamo/*
!assets/source/mixamo/.gitkeep
!assets/source/mixamo/README.md
assets/source/tripo/*
!assets/source/tripo/.gitkeep
captures/
